# Widget Testing Gold Standard Rules

## 🏆 Pattern Vincente Confermato

Basato su RegisterTypeWidgetTest.php: **9/9 test passati (100%)** in 4.44s

## ✅ Struttura Obbligatoria

```php
<?php

declare(strict_types=1);

use Livewire\Livewire;
use Modules\{Module}\Filament\Widgets\{WidgetName};

// ✅ CRITICO: TestCase specifico
uses(\Modules\Xot\Tests\TestCase::class);

// ✅ CRITICO: Mock XotData
beforeEach(function (): void {
    mockXotData();
});

// ✅ CRITICO: Test diretti (no describe, no dataset)
test('widget can be rendered', function () {
    Livewire::test({WidgetName}::class)
        ->assertStatus(200);
});
```

## 🚨 Regole Assolute

### SEMPRE Usare
- `uses(\Modules\Xot\Tests\TestCase::class);`
- `beforeEach` con `mockXotData()`
- Test diretti senza wrapper

### MAI Usare
- `describe()` functions (causa errori Pest)
- `dataset()` complessi
- TestCase sbagliati
- Mock senza `makePartial()`

## 🔧 XotData Mock Pattern (Obbligatorio)

```php
function mockXotData(): void
{
    $mockXotData = \Mockery::mock(\Modules\Xot\Datas\XotData::class)->makePartial();
    
    $mockXotData->shouldReceive('getUserClass')
        ->andReturn(\Modules\SaluteOra\Models\User::class);
        
    $mockXotData->shouldReceive('make')
        ->andReturn($mockXotData);
    
    app()->instance(\Modules\Xot\Datas\XotData::class, $mockXotData);
}
```

## 📊 Quality Gates

### Minimum
- Success Rate > 70%
- Zero errori fatali
- Performance < 5s

### Gold Standard
- Success Rate > 90%
- Zero warnings
- Performance < 3s

## 🎯 Test Coverage Obbligatoria

1. **Core Rendering**: widget rendering per ogni tipo
2. **Form Interaction**: input/output data flow
3. **Business Logic**: validation e error handling
4. **Integration**: XotData e resource resolution

## ❌ Anti-Pattern Critici

```php
// ❌ MAI fare questo
describe('Widget Tests', function () {
    // Causa: "Undefined property: $__latestDescription"
});

dataset('types', ['patient', 'doctor']);
// Causa: errori inizializzazione Pest

uses(Tests\TestCase::class);
// Causa: conflict resolution
```

